# Nivra (always)

Next.js App Router app. Shared math is `@nivra/finance`. Shared UI is `@nivra/ui`. Calculate is `POST /api/calculate/:id` on the same origin.

- Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/API_CONTRACT.md`, and `docs/charts.md` before adding a calculator.
- **Never** implement SIP / EMI / FV / tax / inflation / XIRR in React. Call `calculate()` from `src/lib/calculate-client.ts`.
- API percents are human (`12` = 12%). Finance functions take decimals (`0.12`). Dispatch already converts.
- Engine does not round. Round only when displaying via `formatINR` / `formatINRCurrency`.
- Result amounts must be **full INR** (`10,05,434`), not `L`/`Cr`. Compact format is chart axes only.
- **Charts:** follow `docs/charts.md`. Do not default every calculator to `GrowthChart`.
- Do not copy `src/components/goal-sip-planner.tsx`. Clone live `/growth` or `/goals` (`CalculatorPage` + `calculate()`). Empty products may start from `ComingSoonCalculator`.
- New formulas: add to `packages/finance` + tests, then schema + `dispatch`. Prajyot should not invent formulas in the UI — ask Yash if blocked.
- Unprotected Excel is source of truth except Vehicle Loan and Multi-Goal corpus assignment (Full Set). Skip those two unless explicitly unblocked.
- After `packages/finance` edits, run `npm test`.
- **PDF reports:** always follow [`.cursor/rules/executive-reports.mdc`](.cursor/rules/executive-reports.mdc). Clone Goal SIP / MF vs FD HTML dossiers. Never put Excel filenames or em dashes in client PDFs.
